{"entity_id":"npc.chaz","entity_type":"npc","canonical_name":"Chaz / 查兹","language":"zh","aliases":["Chaz","查兹","查斯","茶兹"],"description_short":"查兹是本作主角，新米猎人定位，战斗上能承担物理输出和部分 Technique。","description_long":"新手把他当队伍核心即可：普通战斗稳定攻击，强敌时配合 Technique、Skill 和队友辅助。不要把所有回复压力都压在他身上。","progress_gate":"start","spoiler_level":"none","source_refs":["ps4.sega_mdmini","ps4.community_wiki","ps4.localized_name_audit"],"confidence":"community","answer_templates":[{"template_id":"template.ps4.chaz.zh","language":"zh","intent":"name_mapping","question_patterns":["查兹是谁","查斯是谁","查兹怎么用"],"answer":"查兹是本作主角，新米猎人定位。战斗里可当稳定物理输出，也会使用部分 Technique；让队友分担治疗和辅助会更稳。","source_refs":["ps4.sega_mdmini","ps4.project_notes"],"spoiler_level":"none"}]}
{"entity_id":"npc.alys","entity_type":"npc","canonical_name":"Alys / 艾莉丝","language":"zh","aliases":["Alys","艾莉丝","爱丽丝","艾丽丝"],"description_short":"艾莉丝是早期导师型队友，能帮助玩家熟悉猎人任务和战斗节奏。","description_long":"早期可以依靠她的输出和经验判断来稳住队伍。涉及后续剧情的问题应按进度门控，避免直接剧透。","progress_gate":"start","spoiler_level":"light","source_refs":["ps4.sega_mdmini","ps4.community_wiki","ps4.localized_name_audit"],"confidence":"community","answer_templates":[{"template_id":"template.ps4.alys.zh","language":"zh","intent":"name_mapping","question_patterns":["艾莉丝是谁","爱丽丝是谁","艾莉丝适合怎么用"],"answer":"艾莉丝是早期导师型队友，能帮你熟悉猎人任务和战斗节奏。低剧透下，把她当稳定输出和带路角色即可。","source_refs":["ps4.project_notes"],"spoiler_level":"light"}]}
{"entity_id":"npc.hahn","entity_type":"npc","canonical_name":"Hahn / 哈恩","language":"zh","aliases":["Hahn","哈恩"],"description_short":"哈恩是早期加入的学者型队友，偏 Technique 支援与信息推进。","description_long":"他不是纯前排，更适合用 Technique 和辅助参与战斗。迷宫里注意 TP，不要让治疗或控制资源太早见底。","progress_gate":"start","spoiler_level":"light","source_refs":["ps4.community_wiki","ps4.localized_name_audit","ps4.project_notes"],"confidence":"community","answer_templates":[{"template_id":"template.ps4.hahn.zh","language":"zh","intent":"name_mapping","question_patterns":["哈恩是谁","哈恩怎么用"],"answer":"哈恩是早期学者型队友，更适合用 Technique 和辅助参与战斗。注意 TP，不要在小怪身上耗光关键资源。","source_refs":["ps4.project_notes"],"spoiler_level":"light"}]}
{"entity_id":"npc.rune","entity_type":"npc","canonical_name":"Rune / 鲁恩","language":"zh","aliases":["Rune","鲁恩"],"description_short":"鲁恩是偏强力 Technique 的队友，但身份和后续信息有剧透空间。","description_long":"低剧透上，把他当高火力 Technique 角色即可。关于身世、后续定位或剧情关系，建议按进度再问。","progress_gate":"early_game","spoiler_level":"light","source_refs":["ps4.community_wiki","ps4.localized_name_audit","ps4.project_notes"],"confidence":"community","answer_templates":[{"template_id":"template.ps4.rune.zh","language":"zh","intent":"name_mapping","question_patterns":["鲁恩是谁","鲁恩强吗"],"answer":"鲁恩可以先理解成高火力 Technique 角色。更深的身份和剧情关系有剧透，早期先按战斗定位使用就好。","source_refs":["ps4.project_notes"],"spoiler_level":"light"}]}
{"entity_id":"npc.rika","entity_type":"npc","canonical_name":"Rika / 瑞卡","language":"zh","aliases":["Rika","瑞卡","瑞佳"],"description_short":"瑞卡是队伍中速度、回复和辅助都很重要的成员，常能提升整体稳定性。","description_long":"她的价值不只是输出。关注她的回复、速度辅助和行动顺序，能让 Boss 战更稳。`莱卡` 暂不作为正式别名，避免误收。","progress_gate":"early_game","spoiler_level":"light","source_refs":["ps4.community_wiki","ps4.localized_name_audit","ps4.project_notes"],"confidence":"community","answer_templates":[{"template_id":"template.ps4.rika.zh","language":"zh","intent":"name_mapping","question_patterns":["瑞卡是谁","瑞佳是谁","瑞卡怎么用"],"answer":"瑞卡是速度、回复和辅助都很重要的队友。让她负责稳定队伍节奏，比单纯当输出更有价值。","source_refs":["ps4.project_notes"],"spoiler_level":"light"}]}
{"entity_id":"npc.wren","entity_type":"npc","canonical_name":"Wren / 弗伦","language":"zh","aliases":["Wren","弗伦"],"description_short":"弗伦是机械/安卓相关队友，Lite 包只做名称识别和低剧透战斗定位。","description_long":"他与后续路线和机械系统关系较深。早期玩家问到时，先只回答名字映射和机械队友定位。","progress_gate":"mid_game","spoiler_level":"medium","source_refs":["ps4.community_wiki","ps4.localized_name_audit","ps4.project_notes"],"confidence":"community","answer_templates":[{"template_id":"template.ps4.wren.zh","language":"zh","intent":"name_mapping","question_patterns":["弗伦是谁","Wren 是谁","机器人是谁"],"answer_light":"弗伦是机械/安卓相关队友。这个问题有中期信息量，早期先知道他是后续重要队友即可。","source_refs":["ps4.project_notes"],"spoiler_level":"medium","spoiler_light":"light","spoiler_clear":"medium","spoiler_direct":"medium"}]}
