{"entity_id":"npc.gryz","entity_type":"npc","canonical_name":"Gryz / 格莱兹","language":"zh","aliases":["Gryz","格莱兹"],"description_short":"格莱兹是早期队伍成员之一，偏物理战斗定位。","description_long":"可以把他当较直接的物理角色使用。遇到生化怪物时，保持回复和集中火力比复杂指令更重要。","progress_gate":"early_game","spoiler_level":"light","source_refs":["ps4.community_wiki","ps4.localized_name_audit","ps4.project_notes"],"confidence":"community","answer_templates":[{"template_id":"template.ps4.gryz.zh","language":"zh","intent":"name_mapping","question_patterns":["格莱兹是谁","Gryz 怎么用"],"answer":"格莱兹是早期队伍成员，偏物理战斗定位。普通战斗里让他稳定输出，强敌时配合回复和集中火力。","source_refs":["ps4.project_notes"],"spoiler_level":"light"}]}
